    {
      "id": "austrian",
      "name": "Austrian",
      "colour": "#e3e7ef",
      "brief": "Hold the position until the light goes. Your right is on the heights and can look after itself; your left rests on the battery on Monte Medolano and then simply stops, with nothing past it but the road up from Medole. Whatever comes up that road is behind you, and the knoll is the one piece of ground the day is counted on.",
